file mantra/src/store.rye trimRight becomes trimEnd and read_head's dupe takes its try, so the module compiles under the 0.16 toolchain
file mantra/src/declaration_walk_witness.rye recovered from the dead-letter box; walks every public declaration of weave, diff, store and main at comptime, descending into containers
file tools/m/mantra_declaration_walk_witness.rish recovered; builds the room for real and reads the control's own verdict
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_declaration_walk_control.sh recovered, then repaired -- imports plant.sh for all four seds and derives both floor numbers from the clean run
file construction/standing-equipment.kyri rosters mantra_declaration_walk at tier lap, 7s against mantra/src touched in 4 of 113 commits in 24h
obs This lap died before its commit, exactly as the one before it did. Its four ledger and card files went down with it and are not landed here; the round that recovered the code re-derived them against a spine that had moved on, and this log is landed as the record of the reasoning rather than of the bookkeeping.
recommend keep-going the census classifier is the next lap in this lane -- credit a literal per site rather than per file, and the 130 resolves into the class it actually is
